    "title":  "The Final Descent",
    "description":  "Crescius Caerellius believes the East Empire Company covered up his great-grandfather Gratian\u0027s death in Raven Rock Mine. Explore the mine, find Gratian\u0027s remains and journal, escape Bloodskal Barrow, and return the evidence to Crescius.",
    "npc_facts":  {
                      "Crescius Caerellius":  {
